    "visual": "Electron capturePage of the Home artboard region roughly every 33 ms. First matching sample requires ≥37 of 40 points to match the reference image within 12 units in all RGB channels. Time includes readback. The screenshot can trail the first actual rendered pixels.",
    "design": "Two sequences per CPU setting, ten clicks per sequence. First two are warm-ups. Within each remaining adjacent pair one run per variant. Positive paired savings mean B is faster; no P95 estimated.",
    "pairing": "Runs are paired within each process, not across batches or CPU settings.",
    "probe": "Separate counted preflight, timed runs have no per-node counter. 0 or 0.1 ms is at the measurement resolution."
